{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "对您了如指掌  (Knowing Every Show by Heart)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the administration pantry, Xiaoye introduces herself to Chun Yuqiao and tells him how thoroughly Bu Xiaogu studied every single one of his television shows before joining Xingtian. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我没跟您说过话，但是经常听小谷说起您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "没来公司之前，她就对您了如指掌了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "您做的每期节目，她都很熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "每一期的细节，她都能说出来呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "听小谷讲节目啊，总觉得像是在看电视一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是吗？小谷还回行政部吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她暂时不回来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她不回来比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你跟她相处的关系不好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "没有没有，我跟她是好朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我是觉得她不适合待在行政部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她应该去搞点制作，干点大事。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我没跟您说过话，但是经常听小谷说起您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have never spoken with you before, though I often hear Xiaogu talk about you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "没来公司之前，她就对您了如指掌了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even before joining the company, she already knew your work inside out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "您做的每期节目，她都很熟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every episode of the shows you made, she knows by heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "每一期的细节，她都能说出来呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She can even recount the details of every single episode.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "听小谷讲节目啊，总觉得像是在看电视一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listening to Xiaogu describe a show always feels just like watching television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是吗？小谷还回行政部吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that so? Is Xiaogu coming back to the administration department?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她暂时不回来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She will not be coming back for the time being.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她不回来比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is better if she does not come back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你跟她相处的关系不好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you not get along well with her?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "没有没有，我跟她是好朋友。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all, she and I are good friends.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我是觉得她不适合待在行政部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just feel she does not belong in the administration department.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "她应该去搞点制作，干点大事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She ought to go work in production and do something big.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我没跟您说过话，但是经常听小谷说起您。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "没来公司之前，她就对您了如指掌了。",
      "gap": 0.5
